  "title": "Why Did You Get 3 Potatoes? (Master Clear English Pronunciation)",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-22 21:52:29",
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.27,
      "end": 2.9699999999999998,
      "en": "A real mixup happened at",
      "zh": "欸你知道嗎，"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 2.9699999999999998,
      "end": 3.96,
      "en": "a grocery store.",
      "zh": "超市剛發生了一場大烏龍。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 4.879,
      "end": 8.66,
      "en": "A shopper asked for one sweet potato,",
      "zh": "有個客人明明只想買一條地瓜，"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 8.66,
      "end": 12.179,
      "en": "but the cashier gave him\nthree regular potatoes!",
      "zh": "結果店員居然給了他三顆馬鈴薯！"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 13.119,
      "end": 14.0,
      "en": "He looked at the bag",
      "zh": "他當時拎著袋子，"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 13.88,
      "end": 15.82,
      "en": "and felt so confused.",
      "zh": "滿臉都是問號。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 16.949,
      "end": 17.94,
      "en": "Oh,",
      "zh": "哎唷，"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 17.94,
      "end": 19.07,
      "en": "that actually happens a lot!",
      "zh": "這情況其實超級常見的！"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 19.76,
      "end": 22.85,
      "en": "If you drop the 't' in 'sweet,'",
      "zh": "你想喔，"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 22.85,
      "end": 24.019,
      "en": "it sounds like 'swee.",
      "zh": "如果你把 sweet 的 t 省略掉，"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 25.17,
      "end": 26.37,
      "en": "In a noisy store,",
      "zh": "聽起來就會像 swee。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 26.37,
      "end": 28.809,
      "en": "a cashier can easily hear 'three.",
      "zh": "在吵雜的超市裡，"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 30.109,
      "end": 31.26,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "店員真的很容易就聽成\nthree（三）。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 31.26,
      "end": 32.5,
      "en": "Just from missing one letter?",
      "zh": "真的假的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 33.31,
      "end": 34.84,
      "en": "How can someone avoid that?",
      "zh": "就因為少唸一個字母而已？"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 35.82,
      "end": 36.729,
      "en": "Two easy tips.",
      "zh": "那到底要怎麼說才不會誤會啊？"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 36.729,
      "end": 38.35,
      "en": "First,",
      "zh": "我有兩個小撇步。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 38.35,
      "end": 39.67,
      "en": "say the final",
      "zh": "第一，"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 39.67,
      "end": 41.1,
      "en": "'t' clearly:",
      "zh": "把結尾的 t 發清楚，"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 41.1,
      "end": 41.369,
      "en": "'sweet.",
      "zh": "唸成 swee-t。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 42.88,
      "end": 43.789,
      "en": "Second,",
      "zh": "第二，"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 43.789,
      "end": 45.909,
      "en": "put the stress on 'SWEET,'",
      "zh": "重音要放在 SWEET 上面，"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 45.909,
      "end": 47.7,
      "en": "like 'a SWEET potato.",
      "zh": "唸成 a SWEET potato。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 48.649,
      "end": 50.24,
      "en": "When you say 'three potatoes,'",
      "zh": "但如果你說 three potatoes，"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 50.24,
      "end": 52.359,
      "en": "the stress moves to 'poTAtoes.",
      "zh": "重音就會跑到\npo-TA-toes 那邊去了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 53.369,
      "end": 55.179,
      "en": "Oh!",
      "zh": "喔！原來是 a SWEET potato 跟\nthree po-TA-toes 的差別啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 55.179,
      "end": 59.679,
      "en": "'A SWEET potato'\nversus 'three poTAtoes.",
      "zh": "那如果店員還是一臉困惑怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 61.06,
      "end": 63.56,
      "en": "What if the cashier\nstill looks unsure?",
      "zh": "那就直接補上數量，說："
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 64.969,
      "end": 65.98,
      "en": "Just add a number",
      "zh": "Just one sweet potato, please."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 65.98,
      "end": 67.65,
      "en": "and say:",
      "zh": "甚至你還可以補一句："
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 67.65,
      "end": 69.95,
      "en": "'Just one sweet potato,",
      "zh": "like a yam（就是地瓜那種），"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 69.95,
      "end": 70.099,
      "en": "please.",
      "zh": "這樣更保險。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 71.2,
      "end": 71.84,
      "en": "You can even add,",
      "zh": "「Just one sweet potato, like a yam.」\n這樣講真的超清楚！"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 71.84,
      "end": 73.019,
      "en": "'like a yam.",
      "zh": "所以，"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 74.17,
      "end": 76.569,
      "en": "Just one sweet potato,",
      "zh": "我們的黃金準則是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 76.569,
      "end": 77.14,
      "en": "like a yam.'",
      "zh": "黃金準則就是："
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 77.14,
      "end": 79.26,
      "en": "That is super clear!",
      "zh": "把 t 發清楚，"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 80.439,
      "end": 81.939,
      "en": "So what is the golden rule?",
      "zh": "唸出 just one SWEET\npotato 就對了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 83.15,
      "end": 84.7,
      "en": "Golden rule:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 84.7,
      "end": 88.129,
      "en": "Say 'just one SWEET potato' with",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 88.129,
      "end": 88.739,
      "en": "a clear 't'!",
      "zh": ""
    }
  ]
